<title>USA: Essex Corp delisted from Nasdaq SmallCap.</title>
<headline>Essex Corp delisted from Nasdaq SmallCap.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, Md. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Essex Corp said Monday its common stock has been delisted from the Nasdaq SmallCap market because of its failure to meet capital requirements.</p>
<p>The optoelectronic processors maker said it expects its stock to be traded on the over-the-counter Bulletin Board, which is operated by Nasdaq.</p>
